; core-frequency-lift-dictionary.fk — contextual sense recipes for language
; surfaces whose inherited uses can carry control, fear, care, or vitality.
;
; A word is never rewritten. An occurrence + context returns 0..many candidate
; source senses. A response composer selects a meaning cell, then asks for a
; faithful surface. An optional value-aligned alternative is a separate,
; acknowledged transform whose semantic delta remains visible.
;
; Meanings contain numeric cells only. NL strings live only in surface cells.
; Unresolved semantic atoms are explicit grounding gaps, not secret English
; identities. Frequency observations are a separate, presently empty relation.
;
; witnessed: 2026-08-13 -> post-board-v2 native band 134217727
import "../form/form-stdlib/core.fk"

(do
